@startuml hld-pipeline
!include _style.iuml
title File lifecycle — from scan to decision (HLD)

|Pipeline (background)|
start
:Scan input + output roots\n(skip hidden, symlinks, cloud placeholders;\nbundles = one unit);
:Fingerprint\nsize → xxhash quick → BLAKE3;
:Extract + digest (ProcessPool)\ncached by content_hash;
:Dedup\nexact · pHash/dHash · MinHash · version-of;
:Embed (single-flight, batched)\ncached by (key, model);
:Score + descent\n→ Suggestion (tier, candidates, stop node);
:File = READY;
fork
  :LLM rerank thread\n(ahead of cursor);
fork again
  :Proposer\n(low-confidence groups,\ncold-start taxonomy);
end fork
|UI (desktop / phone)|
:GET cards → precomputed READY cards;
:User flings card\n(right / left / up / down);
|Daemon|
:SessionService.decide\nDecision row, commit;
:Executor: journal intent → act → done;
:Pipeline hooks\non_placed → centroid / kNN update;
stop
@enduml
